<title>UK: UK's GEC finance director Newlands to quit.</title>
<headline>UK's GEC finance director Newlands to quit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British electronics giant General Electric Company Plc said on Wednesday its finance director David Newlands will leave the company on July 7, 1997.</p>
<p>The company did not name Newlands' successor but said it would be announced shortly.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
